      "In July of 2018, a UAS platform was used to collect LiDAR data at the Kougarok mile marker 64 field site on the Seward Peninsula, Alaska. LiDAR files (*.lpd) in this data package are raw and have not been processed or corrected. Associated base station files are included in the form of *.rinex and *.rtcm3 files."
